{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/CharRef.html#Lean.Html.characterReference?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">characterReference?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Looks up the string denoted by the body `ref`\nof an [HTML character reference](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/syntax.html#character-references)\n`&ref;`.\nReturns `none` when `&ref;` is not valid per the HTML standard.\n\nNamed references \\(such as `&amp;`\\) must be listed in the HTML standard.\nNumeric references in decimal \\(`&#123;`\\) or hexadecimal \\(`&#x7B;`\\) notation\nmust denote a Unicode scalar value that is not U+0000, U+000D,\na noncharacter, or a control other than ASCII whitespace. ","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/CharRef.html#Lean.Html.characterReference?","kind":"def","line":2181,"name":"Lean.Html.characterReference?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/b35cb10cf2ced51a2fd1880cfdbf75c71ab7a35a/src/Lean/Data/Html/CharRef.lean#L2181-L2217"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Html/CharRef.html#Lean.Html.namedCharacterReference?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Html</span>.<span class=\"name\">namedCharacterReference?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Looks up the string denoted by the body `ref`\nof an [HTML named character reference](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/named-characters.html)\n`&ref;`.\nReturns `none` when `&ref;` is not listed in the HTML standard. ","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Html/CharRef.html#Lean.Html.namedCharacterReference?","kind":"def","line":2174,"name":"Lean.Html.namedCharacterReference?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/b35cb10cf2ced51a2fd1880cfdbf75c71ab7a35a/src/Lean/Data/Html/CharRef.lean#L2174-L2179"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Array.BinSearch","Init.Data.String.Basic","Init.Data.String.Compare","Init.Prelude","Init.While","Lean.Data.Html.Spec"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Html.CharRef"}